<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->[QuestInfo], hoping to ask your consent. Kiiros will not settle too close to [map_definite] to avoid causing any inconvenience to you.\n\nUpon obtaining your consent, kiiros will begin the process of constructing their own settlement, which will take some time.</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->A group of displaced kiiro wishes to establish a village near [map_definite] in order to settle down and end their wandering life</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->The kiiros wishes to establish a new village near [map_definite] for easier communication with you</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[QuestInfo]，希望能夠徵求你的同意。綺羅們不會在距離[map_definite]過近的地方定居以免給你帶來任何不便。\n\n在求得你的同意后，綺羅們會開始著手建造自己的家園，這會花費一段時間。</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->一群流離失所的綺羅想要在[map_definite]附近建立一個村落，以便安頓下來，結束漂泊流浪的生活</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->綺羅族想要在[map_definite]附近建立一個新的村鎮，以便和你進行更方便的聯絡</li>
  </Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->kiiro new settlement</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->綺羅新村鎮</li>
  </Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: kiiro town constructing -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>村鎮建造中</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro's village is progressing smoothly in its construction. Before long, a brand-new settlement belonging to the Kiiro will emerge near [map_definite]. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>綺羅的村落正在順利建設中。過不了多久，一個屬於綺羅的嶄新定居點就會出現在[map_definite]附近了。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: kiiro town resource request -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>村鎮資源請求</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro's town construction has encountered a shortage of building materials... They are requesting [requestedThingCount] x woodlogs from you to expedite the completion of the town. Without these materials, the construction progress will become extremely slow, requiring an additional [finishTimeTicks_duration] to finish. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>綺羅的村落建設遇到了缺少建材的麻煩……她們向你請求[requestedThingCount]x原木，以便儘快完成村落的建設。沒有這些建材的話，建設的進度將變得極為緩慢，大概還需要額外的[finishTimeTicks_duration]才能完成。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: assistance appreciation -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>援助感謝</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro have received the building materials for assistance! Thanks to your help, the Kiiro's town should be completed soon. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>綺羅們已經收到援助的建材！多虧了你的幫忙，綺羅的村落應該很快就能建成了。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro village construction completed -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>綺羅村鎮建造完成</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: A new kiiro village has been constructed near [map_definite]. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>一處新的綺羅村鎮在[map_definite]附近建成了。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [resolvedQuestName] failed -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[resolvedQuestName]失效</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Due to the hostile relationship with the kiiros, [resolvedQuestName] cannot be completed further. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>由於與綺羅族處於敵對關係，[resolvedQuestName]無法繼續完成。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>